    practicalApplication:'Reconstruct a harvest genealogy from source plants to three receiving containers, including one held container and a planted outgoing/receiving weight mismatch. Identify the first point where the physical and digital records diverge and complete the discrepancy record without changing original evidence.',
    summary:'Harvest traceability is a chain of identities, transformations, locations and quantities. Technician I links outputs to sources, reconciles physical and recorded reality, and keeps discrepancies visible until the controlled process resolves them.',
