      {type:'scenario',title:'Outgoing and receiving weights differ',setting:'The outgoing harvest record shows 18.4 kg. The receiving scale record shows 17.9 kg, and both entries are attributable.',prompt:'What is the strongest action?',options:['Change the receiving record to 18.4 kg so the handoff can close','Preserve both results and reconcile the discrepancy through the supplied process before closing the affected handoff','Average the two weights','Delete the outgoing weight because receiving is later'],answer:'Preserve both results and reconcile the discrepancy through the supplied process before closing the affected handoff',feedback:'Data integrity requires preserving original evidence. A discrepancy is a condition to resolve, not a reason to edit history until the numbers match.',references:['REF-MHRA-GXP-DATA-INTEGRITY']}
